"object keys."
msgstr "上傳的文件以邏輯目錄路徑存儲,這樣管理員可以稍後瀏覽,而不取決於存儲桶的內部對象密鑰."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_message_attachments.html.heex:9
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_message_attachments.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
